kind. These sustainably produced mats pack twice the amount of fabric as the BR quality mats into the same space, making them dense and luxurious. These doormat will immediately elevate the look of any doorway.<\/p>","button_label":"buy premium handwoven coco mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/premium-handwoven-coco-door-mats-1-thick","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"text-and-image2":{"type":"text-and-image","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_145_6dc74c2f-e90c-41c1-81dc-a1e4881fdbef.png","image_width":400,"subtitle":"","title":"Thin Version Handwoven Coco Mats - 1\" Thick","text":"<p>PThese 1” thick handwoven coco mats are a scaled down version of the Premium handwoven coco mats.<br\/><br\/>With the thickness being the major difference, these mats also feature a handwoven braid around the edges and are made entirely out of sustainably produced coconut husk fibers (a by-product of the coconut harvesting industry). Perfect for spaces that require a lower clearance, these mats can revitalize any doorway.<\/p>","button_label":"buy thin version coco mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/handwoven-coco-door-mats-1-thick","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"1148b4e3-2cf6-42af-910e-9aa29caa2a70":{"type":"text-and-image","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_138_4ec5eb47-9e4f-4b2a-bbd0-f56186a56a31.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"Vinyl Backed Coco Doormats - 5\/8\" Thick","text":"<p>The ultra thin and modern version of our coco doormats are made by embedding the eco-friendly coco fibers into a PVC vinyl backing. The fibers, standing up, are sheared at a 5\/8” thick height. This creates an even and attractive surface level that is extremely effective at scraping away dirt and debris from the bottom of shoes.<br\/><br\/>The vinyl backing also provides an added level of skid resistance and prevents water from leaking through to the bottom.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"background-image-text":{"type":"background-image-text","disabled":true,"settings":{"subtitle":"Impressive","title":"About your brand","text":"<p>Pair large text with a full-width image to draw attention to an important detail of your brand or product line.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","focal_point":"center","layout":"left","height":550,"framed":false,"parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"37afe09d-e6c1-4ab3-b02e-886b131010a1":{"type":"background-image-text","disabled":true,"settings":{"subtitle":"","title":"simple and effective tiles","text":"<p>Attractive event flooring that is easy to install.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Slate_Black_Tap_Studio.webp","focal_point":"center","layout":"left","height":650,"framed":true,"parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"testimonials":{"type":"testimonials","blocks":{"testimonials-0":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}},"testimonials-1":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}},"testimonials-2":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}}},"block_order":["testimonials-0","testimonials-1","testimonials-2"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Testimonials","align_text":"center","round_images":true,"color_background":"#f9f9f9","color_text":"#1c1d1d"}},"8dee5b19-f3b7-478f-9187-7d6dbce1c9ab":{"type":"hero-video","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"SNOW, MUD\n& DAMAGE","title_size":60,"subheading":"CONTAIN THEM WITH THE FLOOR DEFENDER","link_text":"","link":"","color_accent":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_align":"vertical-bottom horizontal-right","video_url":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/videos\/c\/o\/v\/205bf0dd43474cadbc436af39a1133dd.mp4","overlay_opacity":0,"section_height":"650px","mobile_height":"auto"}},"f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"REGULAR VS PRO GRADE MATS"}},"template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p>The underside of Floor Defender Pro Garage Containment Mats features a tatami grain pattern for increased traction. This patterned backing prevents these mats from lifting and allows them to retain their shape over extended periods of time. Also, the tatami grain patterned backing produces a smoother, less wrinkled surface than the smooth backed regular Floor Defender Garage Containment Mats.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-0","template--14478213218433__f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b-167852603719a9971e-1"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"f2f4d304-6a8f-48b3-a6cd-0466dc6e11bd":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_11T09_24_19_294Z.png","image_width":700,"subtitle":"GARAGE FLOOR PROTECTION","title":"NO MUDDY MESS","text":"<p>Dirt, Dust, and Debris are no problem as the Floor Defender Containment Mat catches it all and keeps it from being tracked into the house.<\/p><p>The Floor Defenders will hold up to 62 gallons of water at once and keep it off your floors until you are ready to safely empty it outside your garage.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"3eb2f88f-12e5-4f87-aabb-ad99d885f103":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_11T09_38_17_168Z.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"GARAGE FLOOR PROTECTION MATS","title":"PROTECT AGAINST CHEMICALS","text":"<p>Keep oil, geese, anti-freeze, and other chemicals that may drain out of your car contained, and away from other possessions stored in the garage.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"9d8d2f29-27b5-4648-b084-5ca9f0b9964b":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_11T09_42_33_705Z.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"Improved","title":"EASY CLEAN UP","text":"<p>Floor defenders are very easy to clean, simply drag the mat outside with all its contents and hose it down. In a matter of minutes, the mat is ready to be redeployed and used all over again.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"49e1522d-4e00-4356-91df-3d3dbada5a3e":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_11T09_45_06_105Z.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"SIMPLE & COMPACT STORAGE","text":"<p>Although the Floor Defender Mats can be used year round, some of our customers prefer to only have the mats out in the winter.<\/p><p>Storing these mats after winter is incredibly easy. Simply roll them back up into a compact size and store it way in your garage.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"e98b186a-cb19-48cb-8775-57d1b1ee5ebe":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"19395395-ab98-4ad2-8cb6-274c48ffe6a1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Frequently Asked Questions"}},"c2c28a4a-2065-470b-9375-0248492fed55":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p><a href=\"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/pages\/frequently-asked-questions-floor-defender-garage-containment-mats\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/pages\/frequently-asked-questions-floor-defender-garage-containment-mats\"><strong>Got Questions? Learn more about our Floor Defender Garage Continment Mats ❗HERE<\/strong><\/a>❗<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["19395395-ab98-4ad2-8cb6-274c48ffe6a1","c2c28a4a-2065-470b-9375-0248492fed55"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"f220664d-cc7b-4aea-a660-b60af2d6dd55":{"type":"featured-collection","settings":{"title":"other plain coco mats","home_featured_products":"plain-coco-door-mats","per_row":5,"rows":3,"mobile_scrollable":true,"view_all":false,"divider":false}},"product-recommendations":{"type":"product-recommendations","settings":{"show_product_recommendations":true,"product_recommendations_heading":"You may also like","related_count":5}},"recently-viewed":{"type":"recently-viewed","settings":{"recent_count":5}},"collection-return":{"type":"collection-return","settings":{}},"16813067656d8f906a":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"3c59fa23-e68f-435b-9c55-2a367f508a08":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/reviews\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}}},"block_order":["3c59fa23-e68f-435b-9c55-2a367f508a08"],"settings":{"full_width":false,"space_around":true}}},"order":